      "content": "REST services for retrieving geoscientific data from PANGAEA's archive. Two complementary services are provided: a DOI-based filter service for retrieving tabular data from specific datasets, and a geo-parameter service for cross-dataset retrieval filtered by geographic bounding box, temporal range, and depth constraints.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: PANGAEA Technical Support\n Email: tech@pangaea.de",
